# Form Builder – Project Status

## Stack
- **Frontend:** React 18 + Vite 8 + TypeScript
- **Backend:** None (client will call PayloadCMS API directly)
- **Target:** PayloadCMS Form Builder plugin / forms collection

## Current phase
**Scaffold only.** Project and directory structure created. No Payload integration, auth, or form-builder logic implemented yet.

## Directory structure
```
src/
  api/        – Payload API client, auth, requests
  components/– Reusable UI (form fields, builder blocks, etc.)
  hooks/     – React hooks (auth, form state, etc.)
  layouts/   – Page layouts
  lib/       – Shared utilities
  pages/     – Route-level views
  store/     – Global state (if needed)
  types/     – TypeScript types (Payload form schema, etc.)
```

## Next steps (not done yet)
1. Payload auth (login, token storage)
2. Forms API (list, get, create, update)
3. Form builder UI (drag-and-drop, field config)
4. Map builder schema ↔ Payload form document shape
